## ===========================
## Admin Tools - en_US
## ===========================
## All player-facing script strings live here, referenced from scripts via
## t("jm_at.<module>.<name>") in scripts/i18n.js. Positional params %1$s, %2$s
## let translators reorder. Color codes (§a) and literal \n belong in values.
##
## NOT in this file (cannot be translated, stays in server language):
##   entity nameTags (graves/holograms/rank prefixes), DDUI live status lines,
##   stored logs & queued notifications, user-authored content, search terms,
##   support-tech diagnostics (support-access.js diag menu).
##
## Lines starting with "## [tx]" are context notes for translators — feed this
## file together with translation-glossary.md (BP root) to the translation
## software so ambiguous terms (Claim, Resume, Back, Kick…) resolve correctly.

## ----- Items -----
## [tx] item.jm_at:* — Display names of the addon's seven custom held items (shown in
## [tx] inventory/hotbar): the admin-panel opener, the player/ticket menu opener, the land-claim
## [tx] wand and viewer, the hologram editor, the chest sorter, and the kit editor. These names are
## [tx] proper nouns reused verbatim in other UI sentences — translate once and keep identical
## [tx] everywhere.
item.jm_at:admin_tool.name=Admin Tool
item.jm_at:ticket_menu.name=Player Tool
item.jm_at:claim_wand.name=Claim Tool
item.jm_at:claim_viewer.name=Claim Viewer
item.jm_at:hologram_tool.name=Hologram Tool
item.jm_at:chest_sorter.name=Chest Sorter
item.jm_at:kit_tool.name=Kit Editor

## ----- Item group -----
## [tx] jm_at:admin_tools* — The creative-inventory item group (category tab) name under which all
## [tx] the addon's custom items appear; it is also the addon's title, "Admin Tools".
jm_at:admin_tools=Admin Tools

## ----- Entities -----
## [tx] entity.jm_at:* — Spawn/display names of the addon's two custom entities: the Hologram (a
## [tx] floating-text display) and the Grave (spawned at a player's death spot to hold their items).
entity.jm_at:hologram.name=Hologram
entity.jm_at:grave.name=Grave

## ----- Blocks -----
## [tx] tile.jm_at:* — Display name of the custom Elevator block — players jump/sneak on it to
## [tx] teleport between vertically aligned elevator blocks (no moving cab).
tile.jm_at:elevator.name=Elevator

