## ----- jm_at.infoa.* (admin info pages + search) -----
## [tx] In-game manual pages for the ADMIN panel's Info hub: long scrollable help texts explaining
## [tx] every admin feature (access tiers and roles, moderation actions, land claims, holograms,
## [tx] kits, ranks, broadcasts/logging, server controls, crafting recipes), a keyword search over
## [tx] those pages, plus read-only 'Current Settings' summary screens (set_* labels, st_* status
## [tx] words, path_* menu paths inserted at runtime). Bodies mix § color codes, literal \n line
## [tx] breaks, '───' divider rules and ⬛ crafting grids — translate prose only; keep § codes,
## [tx] item/entity ids (jm_at:...), slash commands and placeholders untouched, and use Mojang's
## [tx] official translations for Minecraft item, dimension and control names.

jm_at.infoa.access_body=§9§lAccess & Roles§r\nAdmin Tools has four tiers — §aPlayer§r, §gModerator§r, §cAdmin§r, and §eOwner§r. Each tier keeps everything the tier below it can do.\n\n───────────────────\n§a§lEveryone (Players)§r\nEvery player gets the §2Player Tool§r (§8jm_at:ticket_menu§r): tickets, warnings & appeals, homes, warps, teleport (TPA), deathback, stats, and claiming kits. Each of these can be hidden or turned off by staff in §lControl Panel → Menu Visibility§r.\nThe §2Claim Tool§r (§8jm_at:claim_wand§r) lets players claim and manage land. Claiming can be limited or turned off by admins.\n\n───────────────────\n§g§lModerators§r\nMade from a player's profile (Players → open the player → §lAssign as Moderator§r), with the §lmoderator§r or §lmod§r tag (/tag), or by a rank named or tagged Moderator. They see a limited §nModerator Panel§r built from their privileges.\n\n§7Default ON:§r Tickets, Warn, Kick, Temp Ban (max 24h), Freeze, Heal, Feed, TP to Player, Spy Camera, View Inventory, Punishment History, Teleport to Homes.\n\n§7Default OFF (an admin can enable):§r Summon, Change Gamemode, Clear Inventory, Claim Bypass, Admin Claim Bypass, Admin Notes, Rank Panel, Commands, Warps, Broadcasts, Manage Kits, Admin Log, and the Control Panel tools (Server Controls, Ticket Settings, Dimension Locks, Item Watch, Config Editor, Rank Manager).\n§8Each privilege can be set for all mods at once, or overridden for one mod.§r\n\n───────────────────\n§c§lAdmins§r\nGranted by operator level > 0, a player permission above Member, the §9"admin"§r tag (profile → §lMake Admin§r), or a rank named/tagged Admin.\n\n§7Operators get admin automatically (so players can run a no-cheats world). To take Admin Tools access away from a specific operator without removing their OP — useful when another addon needs them opped — open their profile and use §lRemove Admin§r. They keep operator status but lose this addon's admin until you §lMake Admin§r again. The owner can never be removed this way.§r\n\nAdmins start with §leverything ON§r except two things the owner controls: §lManage Kits§r and §lchanging gamemodes§r (both off for admins by default; the owner grants them under Admin Privileges). On top of the moderator abilities they also get the admin-only powers:\n• Permanent Ban and Unban\n• Offline Moderation (act on offline players)\n• Claims Administration & creating admin claims\n• Manage Roles (assign/remove staff)\n• Edit Mod Privileges\n• Delete closed tickets, Storage Health, and create/restore holograms\n\n───────────────────\n§e§lOwner§r\nThe first admin to open the Admin Tool becomes the owner; there is only ever one. The owner is §lnever§r restricted by privileges and can't be kicked, banned, frozen, warned, or demoted by other staff.\n\nOwner-only:\n• Edit Admin Privileges and per-staff admin overrides (including who can change gamemodes)\n• Hide top-level admin buttons (Menu Visibility)\n• Mark claims Owner-Only and clear the Admin Log\n\n§8Recovery commands: §r§8/jm_at:transferowner <player>§8 hands ownership over; §r§8/jm_at:resetowner§8 clears it so the next admin reclaims it.§r\n\n───────────────────\n§b§lConfiguring access§r\n• §lControl Panel → Staff & Permissions§r — Mod Privileges, plus Admin Privileges for the owner.\n• §lPer-staff overrides§r — open a staff member's profile → §lManage Privileges§r to change just them. Works whether they're §lonline or offline§r; offline edits apply the next time they log in.\n• Admins manage mods (with Edit Mod Privileges); only the owner manages other admins, and the owner is never editable.\n\n───────────────────\n§d§lRanks that grant staff§r\nIn §lPlayers → Rank Manager§r, assigning a rank whose name or tag is §lAdmin§r or §lModerator§r gives the player that role. Bulk Assign warns you first, and offline players pick it up the next time they join.
jm_at.infoa.access_title=Access & Roles
## [tx] %1$s = number of active warnings that triggers a staff alert; %2$s = how many mod privileges
## [tx] are currently enabled; %3$s = the total number of mod privileges (reads "3 / 12 privileges
## [tx] enabled").
jm_at.infoa.actions_body=§9§lActions Panel§r\nAvailable actions when viewing a player profile:\n\n• §c§lKick§r — removes from session; LAN/local: server must empty to rejoin\n• §c§lTemp Ban§r — timed join block; mods capped at <=24h\n• §c§lPerm Ban§r — permanent join block §8(admin only)§r\n• §2§lUnban§r — lift an active ban §8(admin only)§r\n• §6§lWarn§r — formal warning; player can submit an appeal\n• §s§lFreeze§r — locks them in position, immune to damage\n• §a§lHeal / Feed§r — restore health or hunger instantly\n• §b§lTP to Player§r — teleport yourself to them\n• §d§lSummon§r — pull them to your location\n• §e§lSpy Camera§r — silent orbit camera; look to orbit, walk to adjust distance, crouch or jump to stop\n• §f§lInventory§r — live view of hotbar, armor & ender chest; take or remove items\n• §lClear Inventory§r — wipe a player's inventory\n• §lGamemode§r — change their gamemode §8(requires cheats)§r\n• §6§lAssign / Remove Moderator§r §8(admin only)§r\n• §c§lMake / Remove Admin§r — grant or revoke admin access §8(admin only)§r\n• §lManage Privileges§r — per-mod privilege overrides §8(admin only)§r\n\n• Warn threshold: staff alerted at §c%1$s§r active warnings\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lMod Privileges§r\n• Global defaults: §2%2$s§r / §9%3$s§r privileges enabled for mods\n• Each privilege can be set for all mods at once, or overridden per individual mod (online or offline, via the profile's Manage Privileges)\n• Covers: player actions (warn, kick, ban, freeze, heal, feed, spy, etc.), panel access (tickets, commands, warps, broadcasts, Manage Kits), ranks (Rank Manager, Rank Panel), control panel sections (server controls, config editor, item watch, etc.), and claim bypass\n§8Path: Control Panel -> Staff & Permissions -> Mod Privileges§r\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lAdmin Privileges§r §8(Server Owner only)§r\nLike Mod Privileges, but for admins: the owner controls what admins can do, with a global set plus per-admin overrides on each admin's profile.\n• Admins default to all-on (except Manage Kits and changing gamemodes); the owner is never restricted\n• Admin-only powers: Permanent Ban, Unban, Offline Moderation\n• Plus Claims Administration (manage others' claims), Manage Roles (assign/remove staff), Edit Mod Privileges, and Admin Claim Bypass (override other admins' claims)\n§8Path: Control Panel -> Staff & Permissions -> Admin Privileges§r\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lSpectator Safety§r\nPutting yourself in Spectator (especially with cheats off) can otherwise soft-lock you out of the menus. You get a heads-up first, and while in Spectator you can press §lSneak + Jump§r together, or just respawn, to reopen the gamemode menu and switch back.
jm_at.infoa.actions_title=Actions & Moderation
jm_at.infoa.broadcasts_body=§9§lBroadcasts§r\nSend one-time multi-line announcements, or schedule recurring broadcasts at custom intervals. Both open a preview screen showing exactly how the message will look, and accept §l&§r color codes (e.g. §l&6§r gold).\n• Scheduled broadcasts: §2%1$s active§r / §9%2$s total§r\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lAdmin Log§r\nAll significant admin actions are recorded with timestamp and acting staff name.\n• §6Action Log§r — filter by action type to find specific events\n• §6Rollcall§r — session join/leave log for all players\n• §6Staff Activity§r — actions grouped by staff member\n• §6Storage Health§r — capacity of tickets, claims, logs & registry §8(admin only)§r\n• §6Log Settings§r — choose which optional events are recorded and how many entries are kept; audit actions are always logged §8(admin only)§r\n• The owner can clear the log from the log hub
