jm_at.infoa.holograms_body=§9§lHolograms§r §8(admin only)§r\nPlace floating text displays in the world using the §2Hologram Tool§r (§8jm_at:hologram_tool§r).\n\n§7§lCreating:§r\n• Use the Hologram Tool on any block to open the creation menu\n• Add up to §210§r lines of text, §260§r characters per line\n• Adjust the position (X/Y/Z) before placing\n• Preview your text before placing\n\n§7§lScoreboard mode:§r\n• When creating a hologram you can choose §lText§r or §lScoreboard§r\n• A Scoreboard hologram is built on one preview screen: pick the objective (or create one on the spot), set a title, and choose how many rows to show\n• Pick a row layout from ready-made styles or write a custom one ({rank} {name} {score}); titles and rows accept §l&§r color codes\n• Options: sort High→Low or Low→High, hide offline players, and comma-format scores\n• It refreshes automatically (about every 10 seconds) as scores change\n\n§7§lEditing:§r\n• Interact with an existing hologram while holding the Hologram Tool to open the edit menu\n• Edit individual lines, add new lines, adjust position, or remove the hologram\n• Blank lines are automatically removed on save; use a space for an empty line\n\n§7§lFormatting:§r\n• Supports Minecraft color and style codes (§ formatting)\n• Colors persist per line\n\n§7§lRestore:§r\n• If hologram entities despawn (e.g. chunk unload issues), use §6Restore Holograms§r in the Control Panel to recover them\n§8Path: Admin Tool -> Admin Panel -> Control Panel -> Restore Holograms§r\n\n§c§lRemoving§r\n• Holograms can be removed by accessing the edit menu and selecting the remove option.\n• Alternatively, they can be removed using §5/kill @e[type=jm_at:hologram]§r and §5/kill @e[type=jm_at:hologram_v2]§r, but be careful as this will remove all holograms without confirmation.\n• Use §5/kill @e[type=jm_at:hologram,r=5]§r or §5/kill @e[type=jm_at:hologram_v2,r=5]§r to target holograms in a radius of 5 blocks for safer mass removal.\n\n\n§c§lCaution: Each hologram uses 2 entities. Like any mob or entity, they may cause performance issues if not managed properly.§r
jm_at.infoa.holograms_title=Holograms
jm_at.infoa.hub_body=§w§lAdmin Tools§r — Admin Panel\n\nAdmin access is granted by operator level > 0, player permission above Member, or the "admin" tag. §8Moderators see a limited panel based on their assigned privileges.§r\n\nPick a category below to learn more.\n\nFor help, suggestions, or feedback on the addon, join my Discord:§r\n§whttps://discord.gg/ZsrM5HqHdS§r\n\nOr visit §whttps://jmaddons.support§r\n\n
