jm_at.infoa.kits_body=§9§lKits§r\nKits are ready-made item bundles. Staff create and edit them; players claim them.\n\n§9§lManaging kits §8(staff)§r\nOpen the §2Kit Editor§r (the craftable Kit Tool) to create, edit, and delete kits. Managing kits needs the §lManage Kits§r privilege (off by default for mods and admins; the owner can grant it). The editor has its own §lKit Info§r guide with full details.\n\n§9§lClaiming kits §8(players)§r\nPlayers claim kits from the §lKits§r section of their §2Player Tool§r, not the Kit Editor.\n\n§9§lVisibility§r\nShow or hide the player Kits button under §fControl Panel → Menu Visibility§r. Each kit can also be hidden until a player meets its rank/playtime requirement, or shown locked.
