jm_at.infoa.ranks_body=§9§lRank Manager§r\n• Ranks defined: §9%1$s§r\n\n§7§lFeatures:§r\n• §6Rank Database§r — add, edit & remove predefined ranks\n• §6Bulk Assign§r — assign a rank to many players at once (online & offline)\n• §6Bulk Remove§r — remove a rank from all or selected players\n• §6Staff Rank Settings§r — customize the default [Admin] and [Mod] tags, and toggle per-staff custom ranks\n• §6Playtime Ranks§r — automatic rank promotion based on playtime thresholds\n• §6Bonus Playtime§r — credit untracked playtime to players so they reach rank thresholds faster\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lStaff Tags§r\n• Admin tag: %2$s§r\n• Mod tag: %3$s§r\n• Hide staff tags: %4$s\n• Per-staff custom ranks: %5$s\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lPlaytime Ranks§r  %6$s\nAutomatic rank promotion based on total playtime. Only time spent in the world counts.\n• Thresholds configured: §9%7$s§r\n• Override manual ranks: %8$s
jm_at.infoa.ranks_title=Ranks & Progression
