jm_at.infoa.tickets_body=§w§lTickets§r  %1$s\nReview and manage player-submitted support tickets.\n• Max open tickets: §2%2$s§r per player\n• Submission cooldown: §2%3$s§r\n• Categories: %4$s\n• Auto-delete closed: %5$s (after submitter has viewed)\n\n§7§lLifecycle:§r §2Open§r → §6Claimed§r → §sResolved§r → §8Closed§r\n• Claim a ticket to signal you are actively handling it\n• Reply to add notes visible to the player\n• Resolve with a resolution note, or close manually\n• TP to the submission location §8(admin only)§r\n• Delete closed tickets §8(admin + Ticket Settings)§r\n• Resolved tickets auto-close after the submitter views them\n\n───────────────────\n§w§lPlayers§r\nBrowse §wOnline§r players, §wOffline§r records, or §wSearch by Name§r. Select a player to open their profile.\n\n§lProfile tabs:§r\n• §6§lView Tickets§r — tickets submitted by this player\n• §6§lPunishment History§r — full record of past bans, kicks & warns\n• §6§lWarnings§r — active warnings & pending appeals §8(shown when warnings exist)§r\n• §6§lSpy History§r — log of spy sessions on this player\n• §6§lAdmin Notes§r — private staff-only notes\n• §6§lRank§r — set, hide or remove a custom name tag
