jm_at.infop.gen_afk_on=You will be marked as AFK after a period of inactivity. Moving, looking around, or interacting with blocks resets the timer.\n• AFK warning after: §2%1$s§r min of idle\n• AFK kick: %2$s\n
jm_at.infop.gen_afk_staff_exempt=• Staff members are exempt from AFK detection\n
jm_at.infop.gen_afk_title_note=• When marked AFK, an on-screen title appears until you move\n\n
jm_at.infop.gen_dimlocks_elevator=───────────────────\n§9§lDimension Locks§r\nAdmins can temporarily lock access to the Nether or the End. While locked, all teleports (homes, warps, TPA) to that dimension are blocked and players inside will be sent to spawn.\n• Nether: %1$s§r  •  End: %2$s§r\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lElevator§r\nStand on an elevator pad and §ljump§r to teleport up, or §lsneak§r to teleport down. The elevator searches up to 128 blocks for the next pad in that direction. If a block is in the way above the destination, the teleport is blocked.\n• Elevator pads are craftable items available in the recipe book\n• Stack pads at different heights in the same column to chain floors\n\n
jm_at.infop.gen_ranks=───────────────────\n§9§lPlaytime Ranks§r  §2Enabled§r\nYour rank is automatically assigned based on your total playtime. The longer you play, the higher your rank. Only time spent in the world counts.
jm_at.infop.gen_ranks_override=\n• Override manual ranks: %1$s§r
jm_at.infop.gen_stats=§2§lYour Stats§r\n§8Data collected while in the world with this addon.§r\n• §fPlaytime:§r %1$s\n• §fMob Kills:§r %2$s  •  §fPlayer Kills:§r %3$s  •  §fDeaths:§r %4$s\n• §fBlocks Mined:§r %5$s  •  §fPlaced:§r %6$s\n• §fDistance Traveled:§r %7$s blocks\n• §8First joined: %8$s§r\n\n───────────────────\n
jm_at.infop.gen_title=General
jm_at.infop.hub_body=§9§lAdmin Tools§r — Player Menu\n\nPick a category below to learn more.\n\nFor help, suggestions, or feedback on the addon, join my Discord:§r\n§9https://discord.gg/ZsrM5HqHdS§r\n\nOr visit §9https://jmaddons.support§r\n\n
jm_at.infop.hub_title=Player Menu Info
jm_at.infop.kits_body=§9§lKits§r\nKits are ready-made bundles of items. Some are given automatically when you first join; others you claim yourself, either once or repeatedly after a cooldown. A few unlock with playtime.\n\nOpen the §lKits§r section of your §2Player Tool§r to see which kits are available to you and claim them. It has its own §lKit Info§r guide with full details.
jm_at.infop.kits_title=Kits
jm_at.infop.recipes_body_1=§9§lAdmin Tool§r  (§8jm_at:admin_tool§r)  §8(Staff only)§r\nCrafted at: Crafting Table\n\n§8⬛§p⬛§8⬛      §p⬛§r = Planks\n§8⬛§n⬛§8⬛      §n⬛§r = Log\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n§9§lPlayer Tool§r  (§8jm_at:ticket_menu§r)\nCrafted at: Crafting Table (Shapeless)\n\n§n⬛§n⬛§n⬛§r      §n⬛§r = Logs (any type; can be mixed) ×3\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛§r\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n§9§lClaim Tool§r  (§8jm_at:claim_wand§r)\nCrafted at: Crafting Table\n\n§8⬛§n⬛§f⬛      §n⬛§r = Stick\n§8⬛§n⬛§8⬛      §f⬛§r = Wool\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n§9§lClaim Viewer§r  (§8jm_at:claim_viewer§r)\nCrafted at: Crafting Table\n\n§8⬛§1⬛§8⬛      §1⬛§r = Lapis Lazuli\n§1⬛§f⬛§1⬛      §f⬛§r = Glass\n§8⬛§1⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n
jm_at.infop.recipes_body_2=§9§lHologram Tool§r  (§8jm_at:hologram_tool§r)  §8(admin only)§r\nCrafted at: Crafting Table (Shapeless)\n\n§n⬛§b⬛§8⬛      §n⬛§r = Sign\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛      §b⬛§r = Glow Ink Sac\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n§9§lChest Sorter§r  (§8jm_at:chest_sorter§r)\nCrafted at: Crafting Table\n\n§8⬛§f⬛§8⬛      §f⬛§r = Iron Ingot\n§8⬛§n⬛§8⬛      §n⬛§r = Chest\n§8⬛§f⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n§9§lElevator§r  (§8jm_at:elevator§r)\nCrafted at: Crafting Table\n\n§8⬛§f⬛§8⬛      §f⬛§r = Iron Ingot\n§f⬛§t⬛§f⬛      §t⬛§r = Piston\n§8⬛§f⬛§8⬛§r
jm_at.infop.recipes_kit_block=§9§lKit Editor§r  (§8jm_at:kit_tool§r)  §8(staff — manage kits)§r\nCrafted at: Crafting Table\n\n§8⬛§n⬛§8⬛      §n⬛§r = Chest\n§8⬛§c⬛§8⬛      §c⬛§r = Redstone\n§8⬛§8⬛§8⬛§r\n───────────────────\n
