jm_at.infop.tp_body=§9§lHomes§r  %1$s§r\nSave custom home locations and teleport back to them at any time. You can also teleport to your bed spawn point.\n• Max homes: §2%2$s§r per player\n• Teleport delay: %3$s§r\n• Choose from 11 color icons to organize your homes\n• Use §lUpdate Home§r to move an existing home to your current position without recreating it\n• Stay still during the countdown or the teleport cancels\n\n───────────────────\n§s§lWarps§r\nTravel to server-set destinations like spawn, shops, or arenas. Icons indicate the destination dimension. Warps are managed by staff.\n• Teleport delay: %3$s§r\n• Some warps may be staff-only and won't appear in your list\n• Important warps (like spawn) may be pinned by staff and always appear at the top of the list\n• Teleports to locked dimensions are blocked\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lTeleport§r  %4$s§r\nSend a teleport request to another online player, or accept theirs.\n• Teleport delay: %3$s§r\n• Both players must stay still during the countdown\n• Pending incoming requests are shown in the Teleport menu\n• Requests expire after §260§r seconds if not accepted or declined\n• §lLast Location§r — return to where you were before your last teleport\n\n───────────────────\n§6§lDeathback§r  %5$s§r\nReturn to the location where you last died.\n• Teleport delay: %3$s§r\n• Tools restored on respawn: %6$s§r\n• A warning appears if the spot may be unsafe (lava, fire, or void)\n• You can still choose to teleport even with a warning\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lDimension Locks§r\nAdmins can temporarily lock access to the Nether or the End. While locked, all teleports (homes, warps, TPA) to that dimension are blocked.\n• Nether: %7$s§r  •  End: %8$s§r
jm_at.infop.tp_title=Teleportation
jm_at.infop.tw_auto_delete=• Viewed closed tickets are automatically deleted after §2%1$s§r days\n\n
jm_at.infop.tw_body_1=§9§lSubmit Ticket§r  %1$s§r\nReport a problem or request help from staff. Pick the category that fits best and describe the issue clearly. The more detail you give, the faster it gets handled.\n• Cooldown: §2%2$s§r between submissions\n• Max open tickets: §2%3$s§r per player\n• Categories: §9%4$s§r\n\n───────────────────\n§9§lTicket Lifecycle§r\n§2Open§r → §6Claimed§r → §sResolved§r → §8Closed§r\n• Staff will claim your ticket and work on it\n• Once resolved, you'll be notified, and viewing a resolved ticket auto-closes it\n• Staff can reply to your ticket with notes or follow-up questions\n
jm_at.infop.tw_body_2=───────────────────\n§6§lWarnings§r\nView active warnings on your account.\n• Your active warnings: %1$s\n• Staff is alerted when a player reaches §c%2$s§r active warnings\n• Tap a warning to acknowledge it\n• You can submit an appeal if you believe a warning was issued in error\n• Admins will review and accept or deny your appeal
jm_at.infop.tw_kept_manual=• Closed tickets are kept until manually deleted\n\n
jm_at.infop.tw_title=Tickets & Warnings

